        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7110511",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Uncle Luo",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "711051101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "711051101": {
            "id": "711051101",
            "speakerId": 2491,
            "speakerName": "Uncle Luo",
            "text": "If there's nothing else, I'll leave you to look around as much as you'd like.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711051102"
            ]
          },
          "711051102": {
            "id": "711051102",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So there really wasn't anyone named Xiangjun...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711051103"
            ]
          },
          "711051103": {
            "id": "711051103",
            "speakerId": 2491,
            "speakerName": "Uncle Luo",
            "text": "I'll ask around. Maybe it was just a little mistake somewhere. Y'know, like someone forgetting where they live, and such.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711051104"
            ]
          },
          "711051104": {
            "id": "711051104",
            "speakerId": 2491,
            "speakerName": "Uncle Luo",
            "text": "In any case, thanks for helping that \"adeptus\" water the herbs. I'm sure he'll do what he can to defend you from harm as thanks."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7110599",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "711059901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "711059901": {
            "id": "711059901",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#This should be the right way, {NICKNAME}. Let's keep our eyes peeled.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711059902"
            ]
          },
          "711059902": {
            "id": "711059902",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh? There's a campsite here. Could this have been where Xiangjun's grandfather stayed for a while?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711059903"
            ]
          },
          "711059903": {
            "id": "711059903",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "...Let's see if we can find any clues nearby.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711059906"
            ]
          },
          "711059906": {
            "id": "711059906",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "\"Blessed waters,\" Paimon's foot! These waters don't look special at all...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711059907"
            ]
          },
          "711059907": {
            "id": "711059907",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, right. We forgot to ask Xiangjun where she lives in Qiaoying Village... Let's go back there and ask around!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711059908"
            ]
          },
          "711059908": {
            "id": "711059908",
            "speakerId": 2491,
            "speakerName": "Uncle Luo",
            "text": "Since we're already talking about it, I should probably add that we never really knew the name of that herb gatherer.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711059909"
            ]
          },
          "711059909": {
            "id": "711059909",
            "speakerId": 2491,
            "speakerName": "Uncle Luo",
            "text": "He was an outsider, and we discovered that he was a bit... touched in the head the moment he arrived. He claimed that he'd picked divine herbs, but the pharmacy couldn't recognize them — much less buy them from him.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711059910"
            ]
          },
          "711059910": {
            "id": "711059910",
            "speakerId": 2491,
            "speakerName": "Uncle Luo",
            "text": "But he had no other skills, and couldn't make the Mora needed to feed himself, so he had to knock on doors to ask for help. We took pity on him, and decided to feed him. His house was also built using Mora the villagers pooled together.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711059911"
            ]
          },
          "711059911": {
            "id": "711059911",
            "speakerId": 2491,
            "speakerName": "Uncle Luo",
            "text": "Later, some ignorant children would call him an \"adeptus\" on account of his mutterings about \"divine herbs.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711059912"
            ]
          },
          "711059912": {
            "id": "711059912",
            "speakerId": 2491,
            "speakerName": "Uncle Luo",
            "text": "Not the \"Capital-A Adepti\" who dwell in the clouds, I mean. Just an \"adeptus\" who could help protect the village from disaster.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711059913"
            ]
          },
          "711059913": {
            "id": "711059913",
            "speakerId": 2491,
            "speakerName": "Uncle Luo",
            "text": "No one expected something that terrible to happen to him afterward, but once it did, everyone thought that this must've been him repaying us by protecting the village!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711059914"
            ]
          },
          "711059914": {
            "id": "711059914",
            "speakerId": 2491,
            "speakerName": "Uncle Luo",
            "text": "Everyone thanked him, and thus people have been reliably caring for his own home. We're almost there, by the way."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}